[{"title":"夜酌吴裀宅同陈琴窗对梅花有作","author":"祁顺","text":"自别罗浮岁几更，暗香疏影每关情。\n如今同醉东风下，人比梅花分外清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次陈琴窗见寄三首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"鸭江持节踏春冰，千里驱驰两鬓星。\n留得一时清白操，颇胜陶谷唱邮亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次陈琴窗见寄三首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"爱君襟度瑩如冰，别久频瞻处士星。\n此日问奇仍载酒，春风沉醉子云亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次陈琴窗见寄三首 其三","author":"祁顺","text":"世事多虞念履冰，旧交零落半晨星。\n何当早遂投簪愿，来共山中结草亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翡翠","author":"祁顺","text":"风动莲房水不惊，珍禽翔集羽毛轻。\n玉楼谩说为巢好，得似闲塘意味清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丰润城西还乡河","author":"祁顺","text":"思亲曾拟上封章，却驾星轺到远方。\n今日渡河增感慨，水声犹似劝还乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤竹城","author":"祁顺","text":"寥落荒城数亩低，白云山下北平西。\n桓公老马今何在，草树霏微路欲迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春","author":"祁顺","text":"暖入新年淑气回，律端消息起浮灰。\n东人却讶皇华使，带得春从天上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50929,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"温泉","author":"祁顺","text":"浴罢温池百体轻，天风两腋助清泠。\n痊疴去垢浑閒事，须念汤盘九字铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50930,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题箕子墓四首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"被发佯狂不为身，忍看家国遽沉沦。\n平生方寸谁能会，孔氏三仁语最真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50931,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题箕子墓四首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"宗祊颠覆力难支，独抱瑶琴只自悲。\n一曲清歌欲流涕，故都回首黍离离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50932,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题箕子墓四首 其三","author":"祁顺","text":"力谏无能悟独夫，明夷心事更谁如。\n九畴不向周王授，后世何由识洛书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50933,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题箕子墓四首 其四","author":"祁顺","text":"东藩制度旧封君，千载遗风尚礼文。\n欲吊英灵何处是，夕阳荒草锁孤坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50934,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸭江之西二里许有九城基趾相近相传曰九连城","author":"祁顺","text":"此地何年罢战争，春风犹锁九连城。\n辽东老鹤归来晚，四野无人草自生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50935,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿董家峪","author":"祁顺","text":"古洞深中别是春，烟霞为侣石为邻。\n桃花流水溪桥路，恐有秦时避世人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50936,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余奉使朝鲜与其国相徐刚中唱酬颇熟别后不能不往来于怀也适张司译自朝鲜来京徐君赠以绝句三章蔼然寓见念之意披阅有感依韵赋焉 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"使旌曾度海云边，弱水蓬山路杳然。\n景物瑰奇看不厌，满怀情绪为诗牵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50937,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余奉使朝鲜与其国相徐刚中唱酬颇熟别后不能不往来于怀也适张司译自朝鲜来京徐君赠以绝句三章蔼然寓见念之意披阅有感依韵赋焉 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"亲捧纶音出玉墀，皇华咨度动经时。\n归途笑把行囊看，秪有东人白雪词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50938,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余奉使朝鲜与其国相徐刚中唱酬颇熟别后不能不往来于怀也适张司译自朝鲜来京徐君赠以绝句三章蔼然寓见念之意披阅有感依韵赋焉 其三","author":"祁顺","text":"渺渺箕封天际头，别来东望每添愁。\n不知中圣风流客，还忆花前共醉不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50939,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山梅","author":"祁顺","text":"榛莽丛中一树春，玉容娇媚不生尘。\n山深地僻凭谁管，自有东风作主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50940,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀张靖州宗美","author":"祁顺","text":"半月山行苦未休，一尊谁与破春愁。\n绥宁道上频翘首，为有乡人在靖州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50941,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋即景","author":"祁顺","text":"燕舞鸠啼日欲斜，郡庭浑似野人家。\n残书半掩开帘坐，风捲蓬花似柳花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50942,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石阡小咏二首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"日日看山退食迟，满庭芳草客来稀。\n宦游久有思乡念，只恋清閒尚未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50943,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石阡小咏二首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"四面溪山一望平，烟云缥渺树青青。\n黄堂不用良工笔，自有新图入户庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50944,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈粹之将至先寄二绝 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"宪府才名天下知，岁寒冰雪共襟期。\n边城有喜江山动，正是廉车欲到时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50945,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈粹之将至先寄二绝 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"一自洪都别故知，重逢今是四年期。\n蹉跎两鬓将成雪，只有此心如旧时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50946,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野寺山边斜有径小画","author":"祁顺","text":"小小亭台占远山，斜斜径路透禅关。\n白云锁断人行处，惟与老僧相伴闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50947,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔家竹里半开门","author":"祁顺","text":"一簇人烟水竹隈，黄昏沽酒得鱼回。\n柴门欲闭还留却，少待清风明月来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50948,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和蔡太守见寄","author":"祁顺","text":"云山咫尺望中思，五马南来定几时。\n倘念穷途离索久，抱琴乘兴愿先施。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50949,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蔡太守复和示遂答之","author":"祁顺","text":"诗来两度慰深思，一日沉吟十二时。\n白雪调高真寡和，效颦应合笑东施。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50950,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丙午中秋","author":"祁顺","text":"边城四度赏中秋，节序惊心似水流。\n明月满窗人自醉，不须携酒到南楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50951,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"朝出采菱日暮归，掘头艇子荡斜晖。\n无端惊起双鸂鶒，直傍南塘深处飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50952,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝歌 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"断岸平沙水绕洲，小溪都入大溪流。\n渔翁贩得鱼虾卖，日日鸣榔船步头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50953,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪梅为陈宪副题","author":"祁顺","text":"姑射仙人小白兄，冰肌玉骨自生成。\n向来曾睹春风面，月满孤山雪未晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50954,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝端卿佐近日一番新矣粹之书来谓我辈如深涧老松冷看桃李常换春风也因即其言作一绝","author":"祁顺","text":"春风桃李费栽培，一度飘零一度开。\n惟有涧松偏耐冷，天公留作栋梁材。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50955,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄州道中小酌","author":"祁顺","text":"溪含云影树含烟，海绕青山路绕田。\n潇洒草亭闲坐久，不知红日已中天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50956,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二十日至偏桥","author":"祁顺","text":"城郭巍巍镇大荒，一溪环抱众山降。\n太平人物今全盛，不信偏桥是外邦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50957,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅为钟大参题","author":"祁顺","text":"姑射真人玉雪姿，偶陪西母宴瑶池。\n醉来换却春风面，只有清香似旧时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50958,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偏桥夜雨","author":"祁顺","text":"身事蹉跎愧此生，六年踪迹滞边城。\n惊回半枕思乡梦，酒醒更阑闻雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50959,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十二月十三日夜周翠渠请饮有为南戏者","author":"祁顺","text":"画堂红烛醉逡巡，深夜归来月转轮。\n自是斯文情缱绻，不因歌舞易留人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50960,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有自西川来镇远者使獭捕鱼甚巧周翠渠同何贰守观之欲赋未就间以语予遂为四句","author":"祁顺","text":"水獭从来解捕鲜，何人移巧自西川。\n不知所得能多少，慎勿驱鱼过别渊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50961,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翠渠和余捕鱼之作重有所警盖君子乐善忘己之心也顺思心前言之惷而嘉翠渠之贤更用韵以谢","author":"祁顺","text":"惷言鱼味愧芳鲜，好善真成海纳川。\n颜色訑訑今不少，比君奚啻隔天渊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50962,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"路籁坡","author":"祁顺","text":"千仞山头屈曲通，万株乔木翳虚空。\n鹧鸪似识行人意，啼向烟霞杳霭中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木根坡","author":"祁顺","text":"山插青天径路长，木根凌乱树苍凉。\n白云满地闲如许，应笑往来人自忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道逢商者","author":"祁顺","text":"薄宦相縻去又回，敝车冲雨度崔嵬。\n谁言险地逢人少，也有行商为利来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行写怀","author":"祁顺","text":"路上崚嶒半是云，断崖荒涧总愁人。\n勤劳本为公家事，非是王尊不爱身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行怀周翠渠","author":"祁顺","text":"绿暗红稀风雨寒，间关啼鸟怨春残。\n西南山色多相类，只欠周郎并辔看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪口寨","author":"祁顺","text":"水绕孤村山作邻，烟云无迹石无尘。\n桃源不为渔郎到，谁识秦时避世人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次陈公甫先生见寄韵二首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"不喜功名喜读书，翠深庭草懒芟除。\n清风散落人间去，百世犹能立懦夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50969,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次陈公甫先生见寄韵二首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"乡国诗来当远书，十年离思几时除。\n南归会有重论约，已辨骊驹戒仆夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50970,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答吴献臣大尹 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"王事贤劳不暇居，风流才调更谁如。\n公馀赖有斯文念，分得阳春到草庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50971,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答吴献臣大尹 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"学与孔颜为后进，官疑卓鲁是前身。\n共知今日循良宰，定作他年社稷臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50972,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答吴献臣大尹 其三","author":"祁顺","text":"读礼三年守故庐，形容衰槁鬓毛疏。\n聪明不及前时远，虚负牙签架上书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50973,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答吴献臣大尹 其四","author":"祁顺","text":"云霄未竟忠勤志，江海空怜濩落身。\n便欲乘风问真宰，赐环何日起孤臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50974,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"增城郑叔清司训顾道充上舍吴时彦贡士来访即告归途值大风雨思之不置","author":"祁顺","text":"溪边分手日犹高，忽忽狂风肆怒号。\n云水渺茫天地阔，夜深何处避惊涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50975,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别琴窗","author":"祁顺","text":"薄宦归来雪满头，欲将簪组换渔舟。\n怀人不奈萧条意，昨夜梧桐又报秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月梅为石滩陈志子铭题二首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"水横疏影月传神，诗到林逋最逼真。\n还忆罗浮风雪夜，翠禽啼破梦中春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月梅为石滩陈志子铭题二首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"潇洒风情玉雪姿，一梢寒月浸山池。\n调羹信息传来近，看取青青结子时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从弟重器诗来索纸走笔次韵以纸二十幅与之","author":"祁顺","text":"楼高五凤欲凌云，妙手脩来不露痕。\n十样鸾笺愿相助，老兄头白眼眵昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答方彦卿 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"君是诗仙我酒豪，百年情分幸相遭。\n故园风月今同赏，回首功名等一毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答方彦卿 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"少小怜渠志气豪，读书偏喜盛时遭。\n云霄万里非容易，惟愿天风快羽毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬子仲冬上京族中弟侄送过石门而别 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"相送情深过石门，醉中分袂暗销魂。\n举头一望人何处，远树苍茫无数村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬子仲冬上京族中弟侄送过石门而别 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"南北舟中两渺茫，相思情与海天长。\n隔篷侵晓闻人语，犹讶诸君在耳傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遇乡人","author":"祁顺","text":"江海波涛驿路尘，往来都是利名人。\n相逢不必论相识，才听乡谈便觉亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李汉章郎中五首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"数椽别业宝山傍，诗酒相忘旧醉乡。\n风景不留人去远，落花啼鸟送斜阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李汉章郎中五首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"西徼粮刍积渐丰，榆林山下路新通。\n三军得隽风尘静，犹记当年馈饷功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李汉章郎中五首 其三","author":"祁顺","text":"赈饥遥为主分忧，百万生灵病已瘳。\n一派濠梁亭下水，载君遗爱日东流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50987,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李汉章郎中五首 其四","author":"祁顺","text":"忧国忘家一片心，使星何事遽销沉。\n遗诗子姓传清白，不羡囊中陆贾金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50988,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李汉章郎中五首 其五","author":"祁顺","text":"久欲题诗吊谪仙，伤心还记十年前。\n何时斗酒亲携去，酹向绵山宿草烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50989,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月二十七日邀叔厚伯诚可大文哲四内翰时雍司厅元善道鸣德章三地官小酌适阴雨客有难意遂成口号速之","author":"祁顺","text":"买得长安酒一杯，客边谁共好怀开。\n故人有意怜衰病，旧雨不如今雨来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50990,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过天津怀刘世美旧同寅二首 其一","author":"祁顺","text":"天津才子美风仪，山郡漂零老一麾。\n却忆东曹同事后，半生无复共襟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50991,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过天津怀刘世美旧同寅二首 其二","author":"祁顺","text":"万户千门接水云，思君何处再逢君。\n西风一笛山阳路，满耳凄凉不忍闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50992,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沔河","author":"祁顺","text":"娘子关头露一泓，滔滔东下势如倾。\n英雄争战多遗恨，千古奔流洗未平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50993,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芹泉驿一饭","author":"祁顺","text":"省参元是岭南仙，惯食香芹更饮泉。\n今日驿厨供此味，故园清思浩无边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50994,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一月初五日出巡至太原县","author":"祁顺","text":"太原风物颇萧条，官劣民疲土俗浇。\n独有傍城山色好，四时苍翠逼云霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50995,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源县分司后庭双柏","author":"祁顺","text":"亭亭两柏省堂西，乌鸟来啼凤鸟栖。\n愿借化工培养力，百年高节与云齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50996,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍御出巡","author":"祁顺","text":"吏民奔走候星轺，山岳无情也动摇。\n不为苍生求利病，更将何事答清朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50997,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]